Inline Common Type Citizenship
    documentation 'Describes  information relative to identity and citizenship of a person.
    enumeration CitizenshipStatus
        documentation 'An indicator of whether or not the person is a U.S. citizen.
        is required
    include CitizenshipDocumentationChoice
        documentation 'Describe the probationary documentation of U.S. citizenship.
        is optional
    include IdentificationDocument
        documentation 'Describe the probationary documentation of citizenship of an alien or a foreign 
		'nationality of a U.S. citizen.
        is optional collection
        with context ForeignCitizenship

